UI.getAssertion"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ContentView.swift","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — minimal SwiftUI shell with a URL bar and back button."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"FidoUI","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (separate Swift package under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Samples\/WebAuthnInterceptorSample\/FidoUI"},{"type":"text","text":") — the reusable UI + transport layer described below."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The end-to-end flow:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page JS calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.create()"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".get()"},{"type":"text","text":"; the interceptor serializes the options as WebAuthn Level 3 JSON and posts it to Swift."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WebAuthnHandler"},{"type":"text","text":" decodes the JSON straight into the SDK’s strongly-typed "},{"code":"Options","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and hands them to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI"},{"type":"text","text":" opens a transport, runs the ceremony via "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client"},{"type":"text","text":", and shows PIN \/ UV \/ error \/ success panels as needed."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The resulting "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Registration\/Response"},{"type":"text","text":" or "